      ],
      "content": "TL 00 NW         NETTLEDEN WITH         LITTLE HEATH LANE                  POTTEN END             (East side)                                         Potten End 5/209                                   Barn at Justa Farm GV                                      II Barn. C16. Timber frame dark weatherboarded with steep pitched roof now of black corrigated iron. A tall 5-bay barn facing N with half-hipped projecting N porch in middle with opposed double doors at rear. Clasped purlin  roof  with  long  curved wind  braces.  Site  transfered  from Northchurch parish in boundary change 1st April 1985. Listing NGR: TL0171707909"
